    "detailed_description": "&quot;Today, I would like to tell you about one night.<br>One night that changed my life.&quot;<br><br>Tokyo suburbs. Japan, early 2000's.<br>You're an overworked employee going home on a wet and hot summer night.<br>At the station, you discover that your bag is missing after you've been hit by... something unknown. <br>Lights are dim and weird people are roaming in the empty streets. How the hell are you supposed to get home now?<br><br>With anime-esque graphics and a dark sense of humor, <i>On a Summer Night</i> is the first commercial game of Team Wagashi. <br><br><u>Trigger warning:</u> death, school bullying, suicide, arson, alcoholism, car accident",
